@startuml SAGA_Добавление_Лайка

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "HttpLikesController" as LC
participant "LikesSaga" as Saga
participant "PostLikesRepo" as Repo
participant "SocialNetwork\n(gRPC)" as Social
participant "KafkaProducer" as Kafka
participant "WsService\n(Kafka Consumer)" as WS

== Инициализация SAGA ==

User -> LC: POST /likes/:post_id\nAuthorization user_id
activate LC

LC -> Saga: add_like(user_id, post_id)
activate Saga

Saga -> Saga: generate saga_id
Saga -> Saga: update_status(PENDING)

== Шаг 1: Запись лайка в БД ==

Saga -> Repo: update_like(saga_id, user_id, post_id, "INCREMENT")
activate Repo

Repo -> Repo: INSERT INTO post_likes\nVALUES(saga_id, user_id, post_id, op_type)
Repo --> Saga: success
deactivate Repo

Saga -> Saga: update_status(IN_PROGRESS, "Like recorded")

== Шаг 2: Инкремент счетчика в SocialService ==

Saga -> Social: <gRPC> increment_likes(saga_id, post_id)
activate Social

Social -> Social: UPDATE posts SET likes_count + 1\nWHERE post_id = ?
Social --> Saga: success, new_count
deactivate Social

Saga -> Saga: update_status(IN_PROGRESS, "Counter incremented")

== Шаг 3: Получение друзей автора ==

Saga -> Social: <gRPC> get_author_friends(post_id)
activate Social

Social -> Social: SELECT friend_id FROM friends\nWHERE user_id = author_id
Social --> Saga: success, [friend_ids]
deactivate Social

Saga -> Saga: update_status(IN_PROGRESS, "Friends retrieved")

== Шаг 4: Уведомление друзей через Kafka ==

Saga -> Kafka: Produce messages to topics
activate Kafka

loop Для каждого friend_id
    Kafka -> Kafka: Produce to "user_{friend_id}_post_likes"
    Kafka -> WS: Message delivery
    activate WS
    WS -> WS: Update WebSocket clients
    deactivate WS
end

Kafka --> Saga: success
deactivate Kafka

Saga -> Saga: update_status(COMPLETED, "SAGA completed")

== Возврат ответа ==

Saga --> LC: saga_id
deactivate Saga

LC -> LC: Format JSON response
LC --> User: 200 OK\n{success: true, total_likes, saga_id, message}

@enduml
